17	| RHAISTRAT-9010-E002 | KServe inference audit event emission and reliable delivery | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |
18	| RHAISTRAT-9010-E003 | Dashboard per-project inference auditing controls | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P1 |
